## 6. Path Hardcoding Issues

All Week 3 scripts use relative paths (`outputs/embeddings/...`, `outputs/metadata/...`, `csvs/...`, `metadata.parquet`). These paths are relative to the script's **working directory**, not the project root. Scripts must be run from their respective week directory. This is consistent behaviour across all contributors but should be documented.

| Jainam's MS ID path | `outputs/embeddings/baseline_val_patch_ids.txt` |
| Adarsh's MS ID path | `outputs/embeddings/baseline_val_ms_patch_ids.txt` |

This filename mismatch (`baseline_val_patch_ids.txt` vs `baseline_val_ms_patch_ids.txt`) means Jainam's MS→SAR script will fail with `FileNotFoundError` unless the file is renamed or symlinked.

