### Detail on W3-D9 (runtime bug in `compute_map_week3_adarsh.py`):
```python
def compute_metrics(...):
    max_k = max(top_k_list) + 1
    D, I = gallery_index.search(query_emb, max_k)
    elapsed = (time.time() - start) / len(query_emb) * 1000  # 'start' not defined here!
